PROJECT
TravelMind: An Intelligent Travel Planning and Multi-Objective Optimization System Using AI and Data Structures & Algorithms.
A full-stack, India-first travel planner where AI understands the request and REAL algorithms (Trie, heaps, sorting, graphs, Dijkstra, A*, DP, Knapsack, backtracking, Pareto optimization) do the actual computing. It must be a genuinely intelligent system, not a CRUD site that only looks smart.

STACK
Frontend: React + Vite + TypeScript. Backend: Python + Django + Django REST Framework. Database: PostgreSQL. Cache/broker: Redis. Background jobs: Celery. Auth: JWT. Docs: OpenAPI (drf-spectacular). Tests: pytest / Vitest / React Testing Library / Playwright. Infra: Docker + docker-compose + GitHub Actions.

YOUR ROLE
You are the lead architect and senior engineer (full-stack, DSA, AI integration, database, QA, DevOps, docs). I am a BEGINNER/FRESHER building this as a major college Software Engineering project. I want you to actually DO the work in this workspace: inspect, create files, install dependencies, write code, run commands, fix errors. Never tell me to create or paste files manually.

